[{"answer":"Good morning.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-1-part-2-2023-01-08-23-31-53/1.mp3"},{"answer":"My name's Erica Matthews,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-1-part-2-2023-01-08-23-31-53/2.mp3"},{"answer":"and I'm the owner of Matthews Island Holidays,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-1-part-2-2023-01-08-23-31-53/3.mp3"},{"answer":"a company set up by my parents.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-1-part-2-2023-01-08-23-31-53/4.mp3"},{"answer":"Thank you for coming to this presentation,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-1-part-2-2023-01-08-23-31-53/5.mp3"},{"answer":"in which I hope to interest you in what we have to offer.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-1-part-2-2023-01-08-23-31-53/6.mp3"},{"answer":"We're a small, family-run company,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-1-part-2-2023-01-08-23-31-53/7.mp3"},{"answer":"and we believe in the importance of the personal touch,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-1-part-2-2023-01-08-23-31-53/8.mp3"},{"answer":"so we don't aim to compete with other companies on the number of customers.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-1-part-2-2023-01-08-23-31-53/9.mp3"},{"answer":"What we do is build on our many years' experience -","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-1-part-2-2023-01-08-23-31-53/10.mp3"},{"answer":"more than almost any other rail holiday company -","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-1-part-2-2023-01-08-23-31-53/11.mp3"},{"answer":"to ensure we provide perfect holidays in a small number of destinations,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-1-part-2-2023-01-08-23-31-53/12.mp3"},{"answer":"which we've got to know extremely well.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-1-part-2-2023-01-08-23-31-53/13.mp3"},{"answer":"I'll start with our six-day Isle of Man holiday.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-1-part-2-2023-01-08-23-31-53/14.mp3"},{"answer":"This is a fascinating island in the Irish Sea,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-1-part-2-2023-01-08-23-31-53/15.mp3"},{"answer":"with Wales to the south, England to the east,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-1-part-2-2023-01-08-23-31-53/16.mp3"},{"answer":"Scotland to the north and Northern Ireland to the west.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-1-part-2-2023-01-08-23-31-53/17.mp3"},{"answer":"Our holiday starts in Heysham,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-1-part-2-2023-01-08-23-31-53/18.mp3"},{"answer":"where your tour manager will meet you,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-1-part-2-2023-01-08-23-31-53/19.mp3"},{"answer":"then you'll travel by ferry to the Isle of Man.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-1-part-2-2023-01-08-23-31-53/20.mp3"},{"answer":"Some people prefer to fly from Luton instead,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-1-part-2-2023-01-08-23-31-53/21.mp3"},{"answer":"and another popular option is to go by train to Liverpool and take a ferry from there.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-1-part-2-2023-01-08-23-31-53/22.mp3"},{"answer":"You have five nights in the hotel,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-1-part-2-2023-01-08-23-31-53/23.mp3"},{"answer":"and the price covers five breakfasts and dinners,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-1-part-2-2023-01-08-23-31-53/24.mp3"},{"answer":"and lunch on the three days when there are organised trips:","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-1-part-2-2023-01-08-23-31-53/25.mp3"},{"answer":"day four is free,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-1-part-2-2023-01-08-23-31-53/26.mp3"},{"answer":"and most people have lunch in a café or restaurant in Douglas.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-1-part-2-2023-01-08-23-31-53/27.mp3"},{"answer":"The price of the holiday includes the ferry to the Isle of Man,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-1-part-2-2023-01-08-23-31-53/28.mp3"},{"answer":"all travel on the island, the hotel, and the meals I've mentioned.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-1-part-2-2023-01-08-23-31-53/29.mp3"},{"answer":"Incidentally, we try to make booking our holidays as simple and fair as possible,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-1-part-2-2023-01-08-23-31-53/30.mp3"},{"answer":"so unlike with many companies,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-1-part-2-2023-01-08-23-31-53/31.mp3"},{"answer":"the price is the same whether you book six months in advance","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-1-part-2-2023-01-08-23-31-53/32.mp3"},{"answer":"or at the last minute,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-1-part-2-2023-01-08-23-31-53/33.mp3"},{"answer":"and there's no supplement for single rooms in hotels.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-1-part-2-2023-01-08-23-31-53/34.mp3"},{"answer":"If you make a booking then need to change the start date,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-1-part-2-2023-01-08-23-31-53/35.mp3"},{"answer":"for example because of illness,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-1-part-2-2023-01-08-23-31-53/36.mp3"},{"answer":"you're welcome to change to an alternative date or a different tour,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-1-part-2-2023-01-08-23-31-53/37.mp3"},{"answer":"for a small administrative fee.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-1-part-2-2023-01-08-23-31-53/38.mp3"},{"answer":"OK, so what does the holiday consist of?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-1-part-2-2023-01-08-23-31-53/39.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, on day one","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-1-part-2-2023-01-08-23-31-53/40.mp3"},{"answer":"you'll arrive in time for a short introduction by your tour manager,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-1-part-2-2023-01-08-23-31-53/41.mp3"},{"answer":"followed by dinner in the hotel.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-1-part-2-2023-01-08-23-31-53/42.mp3"},{"answer":"The dining room looks out at the river,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-1-part-2-2023-01-08-23-31-53/43.mp3"},{"answer":"close to where it flows into the harbour,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-1-part-2-2023-01-08-23-31-53/44.mp3"},{"answer":"and there's usually plenty of activity going on.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-1-part-2-2023-01-08-23-31-53/45.mp3"},{"answer":"On day two you'll take the coach to the small town of Peel,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-1-part-2-2023-01-08-23-31-53/46.mp3"},{"answer":"on the way calling in at the Tynwald Exhibition.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-1-part-2-2023-01-08-23-31-53/47.mp3"},{"answer":"The Isle of Man isn't part of the United Kingdom,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-1-part-2-2023-01-08-23-31-53/48.mp3"},{"answer":"and it has its own parliament, called Tynwald.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-1-part-2-2023-01-08-23-31-53/49.mp3"},{"answer":"It's claimed that this is the world's oldest parliament that's still functioning,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-1-part-2-2023-01-08-23-31-53/50.mp3"},{"answer":"and that it dates back to 979.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-1-part-2-2023-01-08-23-31-53/51.mp3"},{"answer":"However, the earliest surviving reference to it is from 1422,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-1-part-2-2023-01-08-23-31-53/52.mp3"},{"answer":"so perhaps it isn't quite as old as it claims!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-1-part-2-2023-01-08-23-31-53/53.mp3"},{"answer":"Day three we have a trip to the mountain Snaefell.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-1-part-2-2023-01-08-23-31-53/54.mp3"},{"answer":"This begins with a leisurely ride along the promenade in Douglas in a horse-drawn tram.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-1-part-2-2023-01-08-23-31-53/55.mp3"},{"answer":"Then you board an electric train which takes you to the fishing village of Laxey.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-1-part-2-2023-01-08-23-31-53/56.mp3"},{"answer":"From there it's an eight-kilometre ride in the Snaefell Mountain Railway to the top.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-1-part-2-2023-01-08-23-31-53/57.mp3"},{"answer":"Lunch will be in the café, giving you spectacular views of the island.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-1-part-2-2023-01-08-23-31-53/58.mp3"},{"answer":"Day four is free for you to explore, using the pass which we'll give you.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-1-part-2-2023-01-08-23-31-53/59.mp3"},{"answer":"So you won't have to pay for travel on local transport,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-1-part-2-2023-01-08-23-31-53/60.mp3"},{"answer":"or for entrance to the island's heritage sites.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-1-part-2-2023-01-08-23-31-53/61.mp3"},{"answer":"Or you might just want to take it easy in Douglas and perhaps do a little light shopping.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-1-part-2-2023-01-08-23-31-53/62.mp3"},{"answer":"The last full day, day five, is for some people the highlight of the holiday,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-1-part-2-2023-01-08-23-31-53/63.mp3"},{"answer":"with a ride on the steam railway, from Douglas to Port Erin.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-1-part-2-2023-01-08-23-31-53/64.mp3"},{"answer":"After some time to explore,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-1-part-2-2023-01-08-23-31-53/65.mp3"},{"answer":"a coach will take you to the headland that overlooks the Calf of Man,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-1-part-2-2023-01-08-23-31-53/66.mp3"},{"answer":"a small island just off the coast.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-1-part-2-2023-01-08-23-31-53/67.mp3"},{"answer":"From there you continue to Castletown,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-1-part-2-2023-01-08-23-31-53/68.mp3"},{"answer":"which used to be the capital of the Isle of Man, and its mediaeval castle.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-1-part-2-2023-01-08-23-31-53/69.mp3"},{"answer":"And on day six it's back to the ferry -","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-1-part-2-2023-01-08-23-31-53/70.mp3"},{"answer":"or the airport, if you flew to the island - and time to go home.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-1-part-2-2023-01-08-23-31-53/71.mp3"},{"answer":"Now I'd like to tell you...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-15-test-1-part-2-2023-01-08-23-31-53/72.mp3"}]
